Not linked into ~/.claude/skills/, and /sync-config leaves it alone.

Nobody types this skill day to day, so carrying its trigger phrases in the always-loaded skill
list costs prompt surface in every session of every project. /vinstall does not link it into a
project: the operator skills read it by path when they need it. When a human wants to type it,
link it by hand and remove the link afterwards:

  ln -s <main-clone>/skills/vreport ~/.claude/skills/vreport
  rm ~/.claude/skills/vreport

Any skill directory carrying this marker is treated the same way.
